B.asi=new A.h4(B.mq,"This is a web page with a different ending","NO SUS shows its code and does not run it. Opened in a browser it would behave like any web page.",!1,!1)
B.asj=new A.h4(B.uf,"The real ending is pushed out of sight","The name has a long gap before its ending, so most screens cut the ending off.",!0,!1)
B.ask=new A.h4(B.mr,"An action name in this PDF is written in a disguised way","The name is spelled with number codes instead of letters, which hides it from simple checks. Ordinary PDF tools do not do that.",!1,!1)
B.asl=new A.h4(B.pb,"This is a macro-enabled Office file","Files with this ending are allowed to hold macros, small programs that run inside Office. NO SUS never runs them.",!1,!1)
B.asm=new A.h4(B.uf,"The name has a hidden character that reverses text","The ending you see may not be the real one. People do this to make a program look like a document.",!0,!1)
B.asn=new A.h4(B.pb,"This document has another file embedded in it","Nox cannot see what the embedded file is. Do not double-tap icons inside this document in Office.",!1,!1)
B.aso=new A.h4(B.mq,"This picture has a web page embedded in it","NO SUS does not draw that part. A browser would show it, and it can look like a sign-in box.",!1,!1)
B.asp=new A.h4(B.mr,"This PDF can send what you type to a web address","It has a form with a send action. Do not fill it in unless you trust the sender.",!1,!1)
B.asq=new A.h4(B.mr,"This PDF carries a script","Forms use scripts for sums, and so do attacks. A PDF app on a computer may run it when the file opens.",!1,!1)
B.asr=new A.h4(B.ue,"This is a script","Its first line tells a computer which program should run it. Reading it here does not run it.",!1,!0)
B.ass=new A.h4(B.mr,"This PDF asks to start another program or file","Ordinary documents do not need this. Be careful opening this PDF on a computer.",!1,!1)
B.ast=new A.h4(B.mr,"This PDF has another file attached inside it","Scanner apps and invoice tools attach data this way, and it is common. Nox cannot see what the attached file is, and NO SUS has no way to open it.",!1,!0)
B.LC=new A.h4(B.pb,"This document carries macros",'Macros are small programs that can run when the file is opened in Office. NO SUS never runs them. If Office asks to "enable content", say no unless you expected macros.',!1,!1)
B.asu=new A.h4(B.pa,"This is an Android app installer","Its name does not say so. Installing an app that arrived in a message is how most harmful apps get onto a phone. NO SUS will not install it.",!0,!1)
B.asv=new A.h4(B.mq,"This page has a form","What you type into it can be sent to whoever made the file. NO SUS shows the code only.",!1,!1)
B.asw=new A.h4(B.LB,"This code has hidden characters that reorder text","They make code read differently to a person than to the computer. Do not run this code before someone checks it in an editor that shows them.",!1,!1)
B.asx=new A.h4(B.mq,"This page asks for a password","A sign-in page that arrives as a file is almost always a trick. Real sites ask on their own address, not in an attachment.",!1,!1)
